   Toolchains

   A toolchain installs tools. When several are usable, choose one.

   ✅ bash 5.2 runs kit
   ❌ jq is not installed · later
      brew install jq
 ▸ ❌ several toolchains are usable for the project: mise, brew; choose one    now   later 
      kit toolchains choose mise
      or: kit toolchains choose brew
   ❌ brew is installed but not on PATH
      eval "$(/opt/homebrew/bin/brew shellenv)"
      add it to your shell profile to keep it

   Left for later
   • jq is not installed: brew install jq









